    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST OUR ANOTHER CARD BATTLER!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088770/extras/87b3e4523bac908038b66fdf90605265.poster.avif?t=1736860191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088770/extras/87b3e4523bac908038b66fdf90605265.webm?t=1736860191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088770/extras/87b3e4523bac908038b66fdf90605265.mp4?t=1736860191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own hero, extract souls of your enemies and make cards out of them, break through tough battles, die, and go all over again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Deck of Souls</strong>, you will:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your enemies' souls into your cards and mix different classes\u2019 abilities to uncover your true power. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your hero\u2019s capabilities and appearance, pick between several distinct classes, use the RPG elements and inventory system to your advantage, and take the proper outfit. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make choices and decide the bosses\u2019 fate. Execute them for their sins or spare them, so that they will come to help.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088770/extras/87b3e4523bac908038b66fdf90605265.poster.avif?t=1736860191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088770/extras/87b3e4523bac908038b66fdf90605265.webm?t=1736860191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088770/extras/87b3e4523bac908038b66fdf90605265.mp4?t=1736860191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own hero, extract souls of your enemies and make cards out of them, break through tough battles, die, and go all over again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Deck of Souls</strong>, you will:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your enemies' souls into your cards and mix different classes\u2019 abilities to uncover your true power. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your hero\u2019s capabilities and appearance, pick between several distinct classes, use the RPG elements and inventory system to your advantage, and take the proper outfit. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make choices and decide the bosses\u2019 fate. Execute them for their sins or spare them, so that they will come to help.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Roguelite deck-building meets souls-like. Break out of an infinite loop to close the hell gates, turn enemies into cards, and build your own omnipotent Deck of Souls! Rolls included.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America",
